o144","title":"梁冀遏绝张纲封侯","accounts":[{"id":"dengzhang-a-f8caeb907ced00e34696","label":"裴注·续汉书","text":"梁冀遏绝张纲封侯","evidence":["dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0002","role":"遏绝张纲当得之封","evidence":["dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac"]},{"person":"dengzhang-p0021","role":"论功当封，不得侯","evidence":["dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac"]},"ordering_evidence":"dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac","source_order":[45,71,1003],"order":7898}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0002","name":"梁冀","evidence":["shaodi-q-p003","dongyuan-q-p055","dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e","dengzhang-q-663a98c9bf0c1ac222c5","dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-p003-shaodi-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-p003"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p055-shaodi-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p055"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"唯纲独埋车轮于洛阳都亭，不去，曰：‘豺狼当路，安问狐狸！’遂上书曰：‘大将军梁冀、河南尹不疑：蒙外戚之援，荷国厚恩；以刍荛之姿，安居阿保；不能敷扬五教，翼赞日月；而专为封豕长蛇，肆其贪饕；甘心好货，纵恣无厌；多树诌谀，以害忠良：诚天威所不赦，大辟所宜加也！谨条其无君之心十五事于左，皆忠臣之所切齿也。’书奏御，京师震悚","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":139,"end":298,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-663a98c9bf0c1ac222c5","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"冀欲陷纲，乃讽尚书，以纲为广陵太守：若不为婴所杀，则欲以法中之","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":360,"end":391,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-97d1a4759f025b664dac","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"论功，纲当封；为冀所遏绝，故不得侯","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":1003,"end":1020,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p055","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1d534a85e282d6495123","layer":"pei","quote":"《英雄记》曰：“成字文开。壮健有部分。贵戚权豪，自大将军梁冀以下，皆与结好，言无不从。故京师为作谚曰：‘事不谐，问文开。’”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-p003a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4d50f73cedf8ad1b3b0a","layer":"pei","quote":"《傅子》曰：“汉桓帝时，大将军梁冀以火浣布为单衣。常大会宾客，冀佯争酒，失杯而污之，伪怒，解衣曰：‘烧之！’布得火，炜晔赫然，如烧凡布。垢尽火灭，粲然洁白，若用灰水焉。”","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8428f1092c0497b3300","start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-p003","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4d50f73cedf8ad1b3b0a","layer":"pei","quote":"《傅子》曰：“汉桓帝时，大将军梁冀以火浣布为单衣。常大会宾客，冀佯争酒，失杯而污之，伪怒，解衣曰：‘烧之！’布得火，炜晔赫然，如烧凡布。垢尽火灭，粲然洁白，若用灰水焉。”","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8428f1092c0497b3300","start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
